implementationPlan.description:
Verify once, fresh.
1. The DoD command, `node --test scripts/tests/prompt-cache-launcher.test.mjs scripts/tests/agent-runtime.test.mjs scripts/tests/resume-progress.test.mjs`, must exit 0. Supply its command, exit code and output tail to complete_task.
2. ALSO run, and report each result in the completion summary:
   - `bash scripts/tests/postflight.sh`: the full suite, including the six reconcile-strong-* modes, V07's intent-* modes and every receipt-* mode. Widen MOE_POSTFLIGHT_TIMEOUT_SEC on a busy box.
   - postflight.ps1 under pwsh, and under Windows PowerShell 5.1 through interop from the repo on D: when reachable.
   - `bash scripts/tests/parity-check.sh`.
3. Mutation proof, on scratch copies only (never the shared wrappers). Each mutant must turn its named mode red; restore and rerun green.
   - drop (a): reconcile-strong-unreconciled;
   - finalize despite the kept journal (b): reconcile-strong-receipt-lost;
   - remove the tree comparison in (d): reconcile-strong-rewrite;
   - remove it in (c): a direct unit run of the record block, or note why it is equivalent to (d)'s coverage;
   - keep the rebase retry under strong (e): reconcile-strong-no-rebase;
   - re-enable reuse of the gate result when the base differs: reconcile-strong-target-moved.
4. Report the net diff size. Expect about 250 lines; the QA cap is 400 net.
